  "solution": {
    "brief": "4. Aggregate!\r\nField Aggregation adds at every step one part that is the closest to\r\nthe highest reachable value point in the field. The component adds parts\r\nadditively over the already aggregated parts. If a new aggregation has\r\nto be created, the RESET button allows to reset the aggregation and restart.\r\n\r\nNB: the FieldAggregation undelying algorithm is not probabilistic, but exact.\r\nThis means that, unless you change the parts, rules, or field, you will always\r\nget the same result from the compoent.",
